		(property "ReqNotes" "Use 3.3V supply for a 3.3V digital instrument port. VIH >= 0.7*VCC; VIL <= 0.3*VCC; not a Schmitt trigger. Inputs 0-5.5V; Ioff <= 5uA at VCC=0. At 3.3V: +/-8mA drive; 2pF typical input capacitance; input transition <=100ns/V; tpd <=12ns at 50pF. Both active-low OEs must be low to enable all eight channels; pull high for default high impedance. Exposed pad is symbol/footprint pin 21: solder to a pad and connect to GND or leave electrically floating; never connect to another signal or supply. Qualify actual cable loading."
			(at 139.7 81.28 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name yes)
